          </details>
          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>Can PPD build the software for my ISV company? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
            <div class="isv-faq-a">Yes. For the right partner and market, we can help design and build a branded software platform with payments built into the workflow.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>Can the software be branded as my company? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
