            <div class="isv-faq-a">ISVs can create revenue from processing volume, software fees, setup or implementation fees, premium modules, and long-term merchant retention.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>Can we support in-person devices? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
            <div class="isv-faq-a">Yes. Device and terminal options can be part of the payment strategy depending on the vertical and integration.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>What if my software is already built? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
            <div class="isv-faq-a">PPD Technology can help review the current payment flow, identify integration options, improve onboarding, and create a plan to monetize payments.</div>
