          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>What types of verticals do you work with? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
            <div class="isv-faq-a">Restaurants, retail, repair shops, contractors, med spas, automotive, healthcare, fitness, B2B services, and other verticals where payments and workflow software can work together.</div>
          </details>
          <details class="isv-faq-item">
            <summary>How long does it take to launch? <i class="fa-solid fa-chevron-down"></i></summary>
            <div class="isv-faq-a">It depends on whether the partner already has software, the complexity of the payment workflow, and the custom features needed. The first step is an ISV strategy call to map the best path.</div>
          </details>
        </div>
